    "body": "We used to have the notion of `prefix` and `suffix` in the codebase, but have since gone on to have each individually styled text element be a `Segment` of its own.\r\n\r\nTo avoid confusion, I'd recommend we remove the mention of \"prefix\" and \"suffix\".\r\n```suggestion\r\n    // Returns the ANSIString of the segment value\r\n```",
